      "text": "JUSTICE BREYER: I would have thought a mechanism would be set up to do that and there is none."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2012-11-889",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "document_hash": "65ce80bc475305c4194168ad7121e63e3ac2be6cf60e641e50f9b9f700fd5c8c",
