      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "2 But I'll tell you where it comes from, which\n3 is Sections 2.01 and 2.10(a) of the Compact, which\n4 preserve the application of State water law. Section\n2.01 says that, \"Each State may freely administer water\n6 rights and uses in accordance with the laws of that\n7 State, but that such -- such uses shall be subject to\n8 the availability of water in accordance with the\n9 Compact."
    },
