      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "13 MS. O'CONNELL: No. What we're saying is\n14 that if there's a State law that conflicts with the\nallocation or poses an obstacle to the allocation of\n16 water under the Compact, then it's preempted."
    },
